{"id":31376908168,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHTjWfiA","head_branch":"l2-cache-wipe-repro","head_sha":"e968e04a3f9de3fd5cae286757a61a972f6d9898","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55546,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: declare synchronized entity classes on native writes DHIS2-21963","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":85102829243,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAT0IYeuw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168","created_at":"2026-08-10T09:56:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T10:04:55Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-10T09:56:23Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/85102829243","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31376908168/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: declare element entities for native writes to collection tables\n\nA write to a collection table needs the collection's element entity\ndeclared, not the owning entity. An entity's query spaces are its own\ntable(s) only (SingleTableEntityPersister), never the tables of the\ncollections it owns, and BulkOperationCleanupAction resolves collection\nregions via getCollectionRolesByEntityParticipant, which is keyed by the\ncollection's element entity.\n\nSo synchronizing on the owner leaves its cached collection stale:\n\n* categories_categoryoptions needs CategoryOption, not Category\n* users_catdimensionconstraints needs Category, not User\n\nConfirmed against a running instance. With a category collection warm and\nin steady state (+1 hit, 0 misses per read), a merge of an unrelated pair\nof categories left a bystander category's cached collection reloading cold\n(+2 misses, +1 put), while an unrelated write left it fully warm.\n\nAlso correct the comments in the category combo and data set stores, which\nreached the right regions but described the wrong reason, and expand the\nnativeSynchronizedQuery javadoc with the element-entity rule.","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"e968e04a3f9de3fd5cae286757a61a972f6d9898","tree_id":"0e9ec8492005dc75c143caf5cf71d88abbadcde3","timestamp":"2026-08-10T09:55:15Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.